WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:23.166
Bird and Kip walked around the park.

2
00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:32.182
They were looking for a new tree.

3
00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:37.127
"I need a strong branch for my nest," said Bird.

4
00:00:37.128 --> 00:00:44.664
"I need a good hole for my acorns," said Kip.

5
00:00:44.665 --> 00:00:47.894
"There's a maple tree," said Bird.

6
00:00:47.895 --> 00:00:53.479
"It looks very strong."

7
00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:58.732
The two friends went up the maple tree.

8
00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:01.997
"These branches are strong," said Bird.

9
00:01:01.998 --> 00:01:04.763
"I can build a nest here."

10
00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.605
Kip rubbed his chin.

11
00:01:07.606 --> 00:01:11.874
"I don't see any holes," he said.

12
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:16.362
"I can't live in this tree."

13
00:01:16.363 --> 00:01:20.076
Kip pointed to an old tree.

14
00:01:20.077 --> 00:01:24.425
"Let's try that tree," said Kip.

15
00:01:24.426 --> 00:01:30.067
"It has lots of holes."

16
00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:34.234
The two friends went to the old tree.

17
00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:38.122
Kip climbed into a hole.

18
00:01:38.123 --> 00:01:41.626
"This tree is perfect!" said Kip.

19
00:01:41.627 --> 00:01:48.783
Bird scratched her head.

20
00:01:48.784 --> 00:01:51.948
"These branches are too thin," she said.

21
00:01:51.949 --> 00:01:56.425
"I can't live in this tree."
